category: Editors
build-depends: cygport 
sdesc: "Writable grep buffer and apply the changes to files in Emacs"
ldesc: "Wgrep allows you to edit a grep buffer and apply those changes to the file buffer like sed interactively. No need to learn sed script, just learn Emacs."
